 on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120151\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- New project\n- New shader\n- In a new line in the shader add a `void` (like in the screenshot) and trigger the suggestions, you can add one character for the name and remove it to get all suggestions\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122087/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122087/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}